  "body": "More space. Two bathrooms. A kitchen you’ll actually love. And a lifestyle that puts everything within easy reach.\r\n\r\nIf generous apartment living is on your wish list, this beautifully refreshed Browns Bay home deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nSet on the flat in the heart of Browns Bay, this spacious two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment offers a combination that can be surprisingly hard to find. Freshly painted and move-in ready, it gives you the comfort of a well-proportioned home without the maintenance that comes with a larger property.\r\n\r\nThe contemporary kitchen is a real standout, with a generous island bench providing the perfect place for morning coffee, casual meals, entertaining friends or simply staying connected while dinner is being prepared. The open-plan living area flows naturally onto a private covered balcony, creating an inviting extension of the living space you can enjoy in any season.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom is comfortably appointed with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while the second bedroom is ideal for family, guests or a home office. With excellent storage throughout, this is an apartment that feels practical as well as spacious.\r\n\r\nAnd then there’s the location. Step outside and you're within an easy, level stroll of Browns Bay Beach, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and local shops. Leave the car at home and enjoy the convenience of having so much right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nWhy this one stands out\r\n• Generously proportioned apartment living\r\n• Two spacious bedrooms and two bathrooms\r\n• Master bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n• Contemporary kitchen with generous island bench\r\n• Freshly painted and ready to move in\r\n• Open-plan living flowing to a private covered balcony\r\n• Excellent internal storage\r\n• Secure covered car park with additional storage\r\n• Flat, convenient Browns Bay location\r\n• Easy walk to the beach, cafés, restaurants and shops\r\n\r\nApartments with this level of space, two bathrooms and a genuine kitchen island are not easy to come by. If you've been comparing what's currently available, make sure you see this one before making your decision.\r\n\r\nCome and experience the space for yourself — your next home may be closer than you think.",
